## 5. [kalkanis2022] Pseudoprogression in Glioma: Imaging and Molecular Markers

**Authors:** Kalkanis SN, et al.
**Year:** 2022
**Source:** J Neurosurg
**PMID:** 36665317 (https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36665317/)

> Pseudoprogression detection AUC 0.70-0.75 without molecular markers. +MGMT improves to 0.85.

